[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.87]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.57]I never got their name until the credits
[00:13.08]now it plays here every single day
[00:17.60]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:22.00]One note at a time
[00:25.62]from people passing through
[00:30.62]a name beside a line
[00:35.66]and part of it is you
[00:40.62]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
